  "bodyHash": "93355d158415a454",
  "content": "\n\n<h2>存檔公告</h2>\n<p>自 v1.42.0 起，擴展縮放功能已內建於 Xaero's World Map 中，因此不再需要此模組。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerminalMC/XaeroZoomout/HEAD/assets/images/xaerosworldmap_01.png\" alt=\"Xaero&#x27;s World Map 設定\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>XaeroZoomout</h2>\n<p>將 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fNcUtCpym\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's World Map</a> 的最小縮放比例從 0.0625x 降至 0.0025x。</p>\n<h3>功能特色</h3>\n<p>無需額外設定或安裝；只需縮放即可正常運作。</p>\n<p>作為參考，Xaero's World Map 在完全縮放時的顯示範圍通常約為 3 萬方塊寬。啟用此模組後，顯示範圍將擴大至約 76 萬方塊。</p>\n<p>注意：繪製世界地圖相當耗用 CPU 資源，因此在完全縮放時可能會遇到一些卡頓。</p>\n<h3>授權條款</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.apache.org%252flicenses%252fLICENSE-2.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apache-2.0</a></p>\n<h3>聯繫方式</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fterminalmc.dev%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1103153365216669797?logo=discord&label=Discord Server&color=#5865F2\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/TerminalMC/XaeroZoomout/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/TerminalMC/XaeroZoomout?logo=github&label=GitHub Issues\" alt=\"GitHub 問題回報\"></a></p>",
